---
description: Decide field-level findings for constructSystem.
args: { goal: string; slice: EvidenceSlice }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to the prepared slice: Turn the selected direction into reusable principles and examples across likely contexts. Define how the system behaves in error messages, sensitive situations, and ordinary promotion, preserving consistency without requiring every asset to sound identical. For each consequential field return a value and evidence IDs, mark established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable, and name a plausible alternative. Do not turn missing evidence into a negative fact or treat repeated volume as independent support unless the domain rule says so.
